---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PixieDust from '../../components/PixieDust.jsx';
import FaqSection from '../../components/FaqSection.astro';

const faqItems = [
  {
    question: 'What counts as a "conversion" for my website?',
    answer: 'Whatever action means business for you: a phone call, a form submission, a booking, a quote request. If visitors browse and leave without doing anything, your site has a conversion problem — even if it looks fine.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How much does it cost?',
    answer: 'Conversion fix packages start at $299. The exact scope depends on what your audit finds — you\'ll get a clear, fixed price before any work starts.'
  },
  {
    question: 'Will I need a new website?',
    answer: 'Almost never. Most conversion problems are fixable on the site you have: unclear calls-to-action, buried contact info, forms that take too long, missing trust signals. A rebuild is the last resort, not the default.'
  },
  {
    question: 'How do we start?',
    answer: 'With the free SEO audit. We look at your site as a stranger would — and tell you where and why visitors are giving up.'
  }
];
---

<BaseLayout
  bgVariant="blue"
  title="Conversion Fixes — Get Your Website to Bring in Calls | Shelby Web Co"
  description="Getting visitors but no calls, forms, or bookings? We fix the conversion killers: unclear calls-to-action, broken or slow forms, missing trust signals, and buried contact info. From $299."
>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="py-10 lg:py-16 px-4" data-animate>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <p class="text-brand-accent text-sm uppercase tracking-widest mb-4">✦ Conversion Rescue · From $299</p>
      <div class="relative inline-block">
        <PixieDust client:load />
        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black text-white mb-6 leading-tight">
          People Visit Your Site. <span class="bg-clip-text text-transparent bg-gradient-to-r from-brand-blue-light to-brand-accent">Then They Leave.</span>
        </h1>
      </div>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-white max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-6">
        A website that gets visitors but no calls isn't doing its one job. The problem is almost never traffic — it's what happens (or doesn't happen) in the five seconds after someone lands.
      </p>
      <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-white/80 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8">
        We find the exact moments where visitors give up, and fix them: clearer next steps, working forms, trust where it matters.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
        <a
          href="/promotions/free-seo-audit/"
          class="cta-glow-shine inline-block bg-gradient-to-b from-[#a3e635] via-brand-accent to-[#65a30d] text-black px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold border border-white/20 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.65),inset_0_-2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25),0_4px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4),0_2px_8px_rgba(132,204,22,0.35),0_0_20px_rgba(132,204,22,0.25)] hover:from-[#b5f146] hover:via-brand-accent-light hover:to-[#4d7c0f] hover:-translate-y-[1px] active:translate-y-[1px] active:shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3),0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all duration-300"
        >
          Start With the Free Audit
        </a>
        <a
          href="/contact/?service=conversion-fixes"
          class="inline-block px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-white border border-white/20 bg-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.08] hover:-translate-y-[1px] transition-all duration-300"
        >
          Ask About Conversion Fixes
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Signs You Need This -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-section-heading md:text-section-heading-md font-bold text-white mb-10 text-center">Your Site May Need Conversion Rescue If...</h2>
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 md:p-6 hover:border-brand-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all">
          <p class="text-white/90"><span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">✦</span> You get visits but the phone doesn't ring — and you can't tell why.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 md:p-6 hover:border-brand-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all">
          <p class="text-white/90"><span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">✦</span> Three different buttons compete for attention, so visitors click none of them.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 md:p-6 hover:border-brand-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all">
          <p class="text-white/90"><span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">✦</span> You're not sure your contact form even works — or you've never tested it.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 md:p-6 hover:border-brand-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all">
          <p class="text-white/90"><span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">✦</span> Your phone number isn't clickable — especially on mobile, where customers live.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] rounded-2xl border border-white/10 p-5 md:p-6 hover:border-brand-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all">
          <p class="text-white/90"><span class="text-brand-accent font-bold">✦</span> There are no reviews, credentials, or guarantees anywhere near the "contact us" moment.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- What's Included -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-section-heading md:text-section-heading-md font-bold text-white mb-4">What We Fix</h2>
        <p class="text-white max-w-2xl mx-auto">Scoped by your audit — you only pay for what your site actually needs.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">One Obvious Next Step</h3>
          <p class="text-white/90">Clearer calls-to-action and lead forms people actually fill out. One obvious action per page instead of three competing buttons.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Forms That Work</h3>
          <p class="text-white/90">We test your forms end-to-end: they submit, they notify you, they're short enough to finish. A broken form is invisible lost business.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Trust Where It Converts</h3>
          <p class="text-white/90">Reviews, testimonials, credentials, guarantees, and real photos — placed right at the decision point, not buried on an about page.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white/[0.04] p-8 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 hover:border-brand-accent/40 hover:bg-white/[0.07] transition-all">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Call-Ready Pages</h3>
          <p class="text-white/90">Clickable phone numbers above the fold, service pages structured around what customers search for, and local landing pages where they matter.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How It Works -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-section-heading md:text-section-heading-md font-bold text-white mb-12 text-center">How It Works</h2>
      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-400 to-lime-600 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(132,204,22,0.3)] text-brand-darkest font-bold">1</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Free Audit First</h3>
            <p class="text-white">We walk through your site as a stranger would and find where visitors give up — free, no obligation.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-400 to-lime-600 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(132,204,22,0.3)] text-brand-darkest font-bold">2</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Fixed Scope, Fixed Price</h3>
            <p class="text-white">You get a clear list of what we'll fix and a firm price starting at $299. No hourly billing, no surprise invoices.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex gap-6">
          <div class="flex-shrink-0">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-center h-12 w-12 rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-lime-400 to-lime-600 shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(132,204,22,0.3)] text-brand-darkest font-bold">3</div>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-2">Measure, Don't Guess</h3>
            <p class="text-white">After the fixes, your site makes it easy to tell what changed: more calls, more forms, more bookings — the actions that pay the bills.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FAQ -->
  <FaqSection items={faqItems} />

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="py-16 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto rounded-3xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] p-6 md:p-10 text-center">
      <h2 class="font-heading text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Where Are Visitors Giving Up?</h2>
      <p class="text-lg text-white/90 mb-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">
        Start with the free audit. It's an honest snapshot of your website's health — free for local businesses, no obligation.
      </p>
      <a
        href="/promotions/free-seo-audit/"
        class="cta-glow-shine inline-block bg-gradient-to-b from-[#a3e635] via-brand-accent to-[#65a30d] text-black px-8 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold border border-white/20 shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.65),inset_0_-2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.25),0_4px_14px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4),0_2px_8px_rgba(132,204,22,0.35),0_0_20px_rgba(132,204,22,0.25)] hover:from-[#b5f146] hover:via-brand-accent-light hover:to-[#4d7c0f] hover:-translate-y-[1px] active:translate-y-[1px] active:shadow-[inset_0_2px_4px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3),0_2px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.3)] transition-all duration-300"
      >
        Request Your Free Audit
      </a>
      <p class="text-white/70 text-sm mt-6">
        Want the full every-page diagnosis instead? See the <a href="/pricing/" class="text-brand-accent hover:text-white underline decoration-brand-accent/30">Website Rescue Report</a> or our <a href="/services/" class="text-brand-accent hover:text-white underline decoration-brand-accent/30">all services</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
